OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer sacked for stealing
OL,4,A40p carrier bags
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree unpaid carrier bags worth #1.20
OL,7,Fhave cost a special constable his
OL,8,Fpolicing role after a misconduct
OL,9,Fhearing found his actions amounted to
OL,10,Ftheft.
OL,12,FLuke Hodgson, who volunteered as a
OL,13,Fspecial constable for West Mercia
OL,14,FPolice, was found to have deliberately
OL,15,Ffailed to pay for bags belonging to his
OL,16,Fother employer Sainsbury's three times
OL,17,Fin December 2025.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
