OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer sacked for stealing
OL,4,A40p carrier bags
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was sacked by the supermarket
OL,7,Ffollowing an internal disciplinary
OL,8,Fprocess, before facing an accelerated
OL,9,Fmisconduct hearing about his policing
OL,10,Frole.
OL,12,FThe hearing, chaired by Chief Constable
OL,13,FRichard Cooper in July, concluded that
OL,14,FHodgson's behaviour had breached
OL,15,Fstandards relating to honesty and
OL,16,Fintegrity.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
